<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFRICA'S SASKO, BOKOMO TO MERGE.</title>
<headline>SAFRICA'S SASKO, BOKOMO TO MERGE.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African non-listed food companies Sasko (Pty) Ltd and Bokomo (Pty) Ltd said on Friday they will merge and form a group with combined assets of 1.5 billion rand.</p>
</text>
